#
# The iwlwifi firmware is pinned to the linux-firmware tag contemporary with
# LFS 11.2. The file was later moved out of the top level of that repository,
# so an unpinned url returns 404, and the tag lives in a query string which
# wget --input-file cannot turn into the right file name.
iwlwifi-7265D-29.ucode https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/plain/iwlwifi-7265D-29.ucode?h=20220913
